{"4252290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Meowgic", "steam_appid": 4252290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4913150], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BECOME A CAT WIZARD</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252290/extras/bbfb50d4256c5ff53f9053df6dce5232.poster.avif?t=1784559240\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252290/extras/bbfb50d4256c5ff53f9053df6dce5232.webm?t=1784559240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252290/extras/bbfb50d4256c5ff53f9053df6dce5232.mp4?t=1784559240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as magical cats — cute, clumsy, unpredictable, and expressive. Customize your cat to your liking.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VOICE-POWERED MAGIC</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast spells with your mic. Learn new spells and practice them with your cat friends. Shoot fireballs at enemies, levitate any object, or summon a massive tornado.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252290/extras/14411d744b476d15048a8d99cda8e77b.poster.avif?t=1784559240\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252290/extras/14411d744b476d15048a8d99cda8e77b.webm?t=1784559240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252290/extras/14411d744b476d15048a8d99cda8e77b.mp4?t=1784559240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR SPELLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign unique names to every spell in your magical arsenal. Words, syllables, wild combos — surprise your friends and build a set that's all your own!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252290/extras/9c8219010f9d5115be88831189f1a0a2.poster.avif?t=1784559240\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252290/extras/9c8219010f9d5115be88831189f1a0a2.webm?t=1784559240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252290/extras/9c8219010f9d5115be88831189f1a0a2.mp4?t=1784559240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHAOTIC CO-OP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic affects everyone. Set your friend’s tail on fire, lift each other with levitation to cross obstacles, meow to revive teammates, and discover hilarious spell interactions together.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252290/extras/d03d2e0d1365d09f6dea5a4cb9a90cc1.poster.avif?t=1784559240\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252290/extras/d03d2e0d1365d09f6dea5a4cb9a90cc1.webm?t=1784559240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252290/extras/d03d2e0d1365d09f6dea5a4cb9a90cc1.mp4?t=1784559240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LOOT &amp; EXTRACTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect valuable loot during expeditions and fight your way back to the hot-air balloon, defending your haul from monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252290/extras/f9e7fa269ae5890d393bba00f4897df7.poster.avif?t=1784559240\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252290/extras/f9e7fa269ae5890d393bba00f4897df7.webm?t=1784559240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252290/extras/f9e7fa269ae5890d393bba00f4897df7.mp4?t=1784559240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FAIRY-TALE FLAIR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore stylized floating islands, fantasy dungeons, and vibrant locations wrapped in a light fairy-tale atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252290/extras/29ee6ad9c2368836e70e692e5722484c.poster.avif?t=1784559240\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252290/extras/29ee6ad9c2368836e70e692e5722484c.webm?t=1784559240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252290/extras/29ee6ad9c2368836e70e692e5722484c.mp4?t=1784559240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BECOME A CAT WIZARD</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252290/extras/bbfb50d4256c5ff53f9053df6dce5232.poster.avif?t=1784559240\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252290/extras/bbfb50d4256c5ff53f9053df6dce5232.webm?t=1784559240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252290/extras/bbfb50d4256c5ff53f9053df6dce5232.mp4?t=1784559240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as magical cats — cute, clumsy, unpredictable, and expressive. Customize your cat to your liking.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VOICE-POWERED MAGIC</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast spells with your mic. Learn new spells and practice them with your cat friends. Shoot fireballs at enemies, levitate any object, or summon a massive tornado.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252290/extras/14411d744b476d15048a8d99cda8e77b.poster.avif?t=1784559240\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252290/extras/14411d744b476d15048a8d99cda8e77b.webm?t=1784559240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252290/extras/14411d744b476d15048a8d99cda8e77b.mp4?t=1784559240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR SPELLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign unique names to every spell in your magical arsenal. Words, syllables, wild combos — surprise your friends and build a set that's all your own!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252290/extras/9c8219010f9d5115be88831189f1a0a2.poster.avif?t=1784559240\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252290/extras/9c8219010f9d5115be88831189f1a0a2.webm?t=1784559240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252290/extras/9c8219010f9d5115be88831189f1a0a2.mp4?t=1784559240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHAOTIC CO-OP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic affects everyone. Set your friend’s tail on fire, lift each other with levitation to cross obstacles, meow to revive teammates, and discover hilarious spell interactions together.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252290/extras/d03d2e0d1365d09f6dea5a4cb9a90cc1.poster.avif?t=1784559240\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252290/extras/d03d2e0d1365d09f6dea5a4cb9a90cc1.webm?t=1784559240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252290/extras/d03d2e0d1365d09f6dea5a4cb9a90cc1.mp4?t=1784559240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LOOT &amp; EXTRACTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect valuable loot during expeditions and fight your way back to the hot-air balloon, defending your haul from monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252290/extras/f9e7fa269ae5890d393bba00f4897df7.poster.avif?t=1784559240\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252290/extras/f9e7fa269ae5890d393bba00f4897df7.webm?t=1784559240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4252290/extras/f9e7fa269ae5890d393bba00f4897df7.mp4?t=1784559240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FAIRY-TALE FLAIR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore stylized floating islands, fantasy dungeons, and vibrant locations wrapped in a light fairy-tale atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"